---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contribute" description="Suggest a dataset, a paper, or a correction.">
	<div class="prose stack">
		<h1>Contribute</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			Every record here is a file in a git repository, so suggestions and corrections go through the same
			review as any other change.
		</p>

		<h2>What is useful</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>A dataset release that meets the rules on the <a href="../about/">About</a> page.</li>
			<li>A paper whose use of a catalogued release can be checked in the paper itself.</li>
			<li>A correction, especially a count, licence, or pairing claim that does not match its source.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>What to include</h2>
		<p>
			A source for each claim: a link, and where in it the claim appears. Suggestions without a source stay
			unpublished, because a curator cannot approve what cannot be checked.
		</p>

		<h2>How to send it</h2>
		<p>
			The repository is private while the catalog is being built, so issue forms are not open yet. Until then,
			send corrections to the maintainer directly. Once the repository is public, this page will link to its
			dataset, paper and correction forms at <code>{SITE.repoUrl}</code>.
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
